2026-07-27T12:37:59.5022901Z i /tmp/Rtmpras1lu/duckdb
2026-07-27T12:37:59.5023222Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T12:37:59.5023584Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T12:37:59.5024175Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T12:37:59.5024961Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T12:37:59.5025665Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T12:37:59.5026396Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
